00:02:01.759 --> 00:02:03.159
and subscribe to her channel.

00:02:03.159 --> 00:02:06.499
Before we continue on with Paimon’s history,
let’s explore the details about King Paimon

00:02:06.499 --> 00:02:09.249
in these ancient texts and how they show up
in Hereditary.

00:02:09.249 --> 00:02:13.620
– [Sarah] Paimon is most often depicted
as a male with an effeminate face riding atop

00:02:13.620 --> 00:02:14.620
a Dromedary.

00:02:14.620 --> 00:02:18.760
Being a male with a feminine face causes Paimon
to want to correct his form by inhabiting

00:02:18.760 --> 00:02:19.840
a male host.

00:02:19.840 --> 00:02:24.680
The in-movie Invocations book adds that “King
Paimon has become livid and vengeful when

00:02:24.680 --> 00:02:29.469
offered a female host”, which could explain
some of the horror seen in Hereditary.

00:02:29.469 --> 00:02:33.719
According to Lesser Key, wherever he goes,
he is preceded by a host of spirits and demons

00:02:33.719 --> 00:02:36.840
in the shape of men with trumpets and well
sounding cymbals.

00:02:36.840 --> 00:02:39.459
Paimon has a great voice and roars when he
arrives.

00:02:39.459 --> 00:02:42.909
– [Zac] I’m not an expert on identifying
musical instruments, but I believe all of

00:02:42.909 --> 00:02:46.810
these sounds are accounted for in the movie’s
soundtrack during the “Rebirth” scene.

00:02:46.810 --> 00:02:48.875
First comes the roaring Paimon vocals…

00:02:48.965 --> 00:02:53.303
(deep vocals)

00:02:53.303 --> 00:02:54.506
 … then the cymbals…

00:02:54.506 --> 00:02:58.052
(cymbals)

00:02:58.052 --> 00:03:00.034
… and finally, the trumpets…

00:03:00.034 --> 00:03:07.670
(trumpets)

00:03:07.670 --> 00:03:11.580
Paimon knows and can teach science, art and
other secret things, such as the mysteries

00:03:11.580 --> 00:03:13.599
of Earth, water and mind.

00:03:13.599 --> 00:03:17.261
– [Joan] Give us your knowledge of all secret things
and all mysteries of the Earth.

00:03:17.261 --> 00:03:20.890
– The Invocations book also makes reference
to knowledge of physics and astrology, but

00:03:20.890 --> 00:03:22.469
we never see the rest of the page.

00:03:22.469 --> 00:03:26.580
Paimon can bestow upon the conjurer great
gifts of wealth, dignities, and good familiars

00:03:26.580 --> 00:03:28.730
and he can bind men to the conjurer’s will.

00:03:28.730 --> 00:03:32.069
He can also provide any answer to questions
posed by the Conjurer.

00:03:32.069 --> 00:03:35.010
– [Annie] You could always count on her to always
have the answer.

00:03:35.010 --> 00:03:36.450
And if she ever was mistaken…

00:03:36.450 --> 00:03:41.267
well, that was your opinion, and you were
wrong.

00:03:41.267 --> 00:03:45.636
– It is said though that if Paimon is summoned
alone then an offering or sacrifice must be made.

00:03:45.843 --> 00:03:48.385
(sobbing)

00:03:48.385 --> 00:03:52.150
He must be observed to the Northwest, for
that is where he is housed.

00:03:52.150 --> 00:03:56.209
– [Joan] We have looked to the Northwest and called
you in.

00:03:56.209 --> 00:04:00.459
– While we only see bits and pieces of Hereditary’s
Invocations book, there are a few takeaways,

00:04:00.459 --> 00:04:04.349
such as the idea that when calling upon Paimon,
one “should (and indeed must) be entirely

00:04:04.349 --> 00:04:06.940
without fear”, because Paimon will feed
on one’s fear.

00:04:06.940 --> 00:04:10.189
We kind of see this play out, because as the
Graham family starts to accept the idea of

00:04:10.189 --> 00:04:14.319
something demonic in their house, the paranormal
activity gets more and more pronounced.

00:04:14.319 --> 00:04:17.889
It also discusses the possibility of cementing
a working relationship between Paimon and

00:04:17.889 --> 00:04:20.979
the conjurer, where Paimon can influence parts
of the person’s life.

00:04:20.979 --> 00:04:23.163
Some examples are given: a difficult co-worker,

00:04:25.090 --> 00:04:25.717
– What?

00:04:25.717 --> 00:04:31.430
– [Zac] ...an uninterested object of affection, or an annoying habit are all problems that Paimon could theoretically help with.

00:04:31.430 --> 00:04:34.840
We don’t really see this in Hereditary,
but we do see an example of what might happen

00:04:34.840 --> 00:04:36.850
to someone that King Paimon deems to be an
obstacle.

00:04:37.558 --> 00:04:38.932
(scream)

00:04:38.932 --> 00:04:43.370
While these benefits all sound great, resurrecting
King Paimon is no easy task, as we see from

00:04:43.370 --> 00:04:45.840
the struggle of his most loyal servant.

00:04:45.840 --> 00:04:49.869
(spooky music)

00:04:49.869 --> 00:04:54.440
– [Sarah] In 1939 or 1940, Ellen Taper Leigh
was born.

00:04:54.440 --> 00:04:58.509
We don’t know if she is the one who first
connected the family to King Paimon, or if

00:04:58.509 --> 00:05:03.379
it was one of her ancestors who simply passed
the association down to her, hence the title:

00:05:03.379 --> 00:05:04.379
Hereditary.

00:05:04.379 --> 00:05:08.870
What we do know is that she eventually becomes
the “Queen” to King Paimon, which essentially

00:05:08.870 --> 00:05:12.940
seems to mean that she is the cult leader
responsible for making sure he’s able to

00:05:12.940 --> 00:05:14.070
find a vessel.

00:05:14.070 --> 00:05:18.160
If she wasn’t born as a servant to Paimon,
I would assume that she took on the role before

00:05:18.160 --> 00:05:19.160
getting married.

00:05:19.160 --> 00:05:23.129
This would give her a reason to have kids:
so that she could create a perfect vessel

00:05:23.129 --> 00:05:24.509
for her demonic King.

00:05:24.509 --> 00:05:27.460
This, however, would not go according to plan.

00:05:27.460 --> 00:05:31.280
She met a man named Martin Leigh, who would
eventually become her husband.

00:05:31.280 --> 00:05:35.760
She most likely married and had her first
kid, Charles, in the mid to late 1960s, and

00:05:35.760 --> 00:05:38.389
then had her daughter Annie in the 1970s.

00:05:38.389 --> 00:05:42.740
When Annie was a baby, her father Martin had
psychotic depression and starved himself to

00:05:42.740 --> 00:05:43.740
death.

00:05:43.740 --> 00:05:45.889
Or at least, that became the official story.

00:05:45.889 --> 00:05:50.300
Not much else is known about this time period,
so I’m going to infer a little bit.

00:05:50.300 --> 00:05:54.230
Perhaps Ellen’s original plan was to use
her first child as a vessel for Paimon once

00:05:54.230 --> 00:05:58.370
he got a little bit older, but once he was
older, he was resistant to what she was trying

00:05:58.370 --> 00:05:59.370
to do.

00:05:59.370 --> 00:06:03.550
Instead, she decided to have a second child,
who turned out to be a girl, Annie.

00:06:03.550 --> 00:06:07.680
King Paimon did not want a female vessel,
so Ellen went back to trying to have Paimon

00:06:07.680 --> 00:06:12.590
possess the older sibling, but at this point,
Charles was very aware of his mother’s sinister

00:06:12.590 --> 00:06:13.639
plans for him.

00:06:13.639 --> 00:06:18.520
One of Ellen’s hobbies was embroidery, and
she created custom doormats for her kids.

00:06:18.520 --> 00:06:21.770
Annie’s contains a compass with the 8 cardinal
directions.

00:06:21.770 --> 00:06:26.590
The Northwest is highlighted in gold, a reference
to the requirement to summon King Paimon while

00:06:26.590 --> 00:06:27.909
facing Northwest.

00:06:27.909 --> 00:06:32.270
Charles’s mat is marked with the Paimon
sigil and 4/5s of a pentagram.

00:06:32.270 --> 00:06:36.260
When Charles realized that his mother was
trying to use him as a host for an evil entity,

00:06:36.260 --> 00:06:37.520
he was driven to suicide.

00:06:37.520 --> 00:06:42.100
– My older brother had schizophrenia and
when he was 16 he hanged himself in my mother's

00:06:42.100 --> 00:06:47.379
bedroom and of course the suicide note blamed
her accusing her of putting people inside him.

00:06:47.379 --> 00:06:51.830
– After losing her son, and primary target to
play host to King Paimon, the relationship

00:06:51.830 --> 00:06:53.840
between Ellen and Annie was strained.

00:06:53.840 --> 00:06:56.680
Annie likely moved out as soon as she was
able.

00:06:56.680 --> 00:06:58.819
Annie eventually got married to Steven Graham,

00:06:58.819 --> 00:07:00.349
– [Zac] She means Graham…

00:07:00.349 --> 00:07:01.770
– [Sarah] …a psychiatrist.

00:07:01.770 --> 00:07:06.060
One might assume that Annie was able to meet
Steven as a patient receiving psychiatric

00:07:06.060 --> 00:07:08.550
help on account of her tumultuous past.

00:07:08.550 --> 00:07:12.910
Annie and Steven’s first child was a boy
named Peter, so Ellen tried to get close to

00:07:12.910 --> 00:07:18.030
the family again, seeing him as another potential
landing spot for King Paimon, however, Annie

00:07:18.030 --> 00:07:21.870
didn’t let her mother get anywhere near
her or her son during this time.

00:07:21.870 --> 00:07:27.669
This led to a lot of arguing, and Steven instituting
a no-contact rule which lasted until 2003

00:07:27.669 --> 00:07:30.759
or 2004, when Annie got pregnant once again.

00:07:30.759 --> 00:07:33.601
But this time, things would be different.

00:07:38.047 --> 00:07:40.267
