00:08:41.825 --> 00:08:46.230
– [Zac] In 2004 or 2005, Annie gave birth
to a second child, who would go by Charlie,

00:08:46.230 --> 00:08:49.110
a gender neutral name in honor of her deceased
Uncle Charles.

00:08:49.110 --> 00:08:52.420
This time Annie gave in, and let her mother
into the picture once again.

00:08:52.420 --> 00:08:56.180
– Which is why I gave her my daughter, who
she immediately stabbed her hooks into.

00:08:56.180 --> 00:08:59.510
– [Zac] There’s evidence to suggest that the real
Charlie was replaced with King Paimon as soon

00:08:59.510 --> 00:09:00.510
as she was born.

00:09:00.510 --> 00:09:03.900
Annie states that Charlie never cried as a
baby, even during her delivery.

00:09:03.900 --> 00:09:07.540
This probably alludes to the idea that Paimon
is a demon with no human emotions.

00:09:07.540 --> 00:09:10.175
Later we see a bird crash into Charlie’s
classroom window.

00:09:10.175 --> 00:09:10.889
(thump)

00:09:10.889 --> 00:09:13.530
Everyone in the class jumps, except for Charlie.

00:09:13.530 --> 00:09:14.720
She doesn’t even flinch.

00:09:14.720 --> 00:09:18.630
If you need further confirmation, director
Ari Aster confirmed in an interview with Variety;

00:09:18.630 --> 00:09:20.700
Charlie was possessed from the moment she
was born.

00:09:20.700 --> 00:09:24.560
As outlined in the demonology texts throughout
history, Paimon did not feel at home inside

00:09:24.560 --> 00:09:28.230
of a female body and this may explain why
she appears to have so many health issues.

00:09:28.230 --> 00:09:31.440
Her peanut allergy is the only affliction
mentioned in the movie, but a lot of fans

00:09:31.440 --> 00:09:35.170
have theorized that she may have elements
of Down syndrome or autism, and if this is

00:09:35.170 --> 00:09:38.590
the case, it’s easy to see how a disorder
could be triggered by an incongruence between

00:09:38.590 --> 00:09:40.880
Paimon and the female body he’s possessing.

00:09:40.880 --> 00:09:44.030
Obviously, Paimon did not want to be in a
female body in the first place, but Ellen

00:09:44.030 --> 00:09:46.970
realized she was getting older at this point
and she was running out of time to try to

00:09:46.970 --> 00:09:50.870
resurrect him, so she created a plan to use
Charlie as a temporary host until the cult

00:09:50.870 --> 00:09:53.840
had the opportunity to transfer the demon
to her older brother Peter.

00:09:53.840 --> 00:09:57.470
In the meantime, she gave Charlie preferential
treatment, took care of her, and even kept

00:09:57.470 --> 00:09:58.470
her from her mother.

00:09:58.470 --> 00:09:59.960
– [Annie] Even when you were a little baby.

00:09:59.960 --> 00:10:02.670
She wouldn’t let me feed you because she
needed to feed you.

00:10:02.670 --> 00:10:06.245
Feeding Charlie may have also allowed Ellen
to slip these black herbs into her meals.

00:10:06.245 --> 00:10:07.742
– [Sarah] He means herbs.

00:10:07.742 --> 00:10:12.100
The use of herbs in witchcraft or occult
rituals are said to make a subject more receptive

00:10:12.100 --> 00:10:16.120
to communication with the other side and ease
connection with spirits and demons.

00:10:16.120 --> 00:10:19.381
– [Zac] This photo was originally supposed
to be a part of Ellen’s photo album, which

00:10:19.381 --> 00:10:23.030
Annie discovers closer to the end of the movie,
but it seems that Aster moved it to the family’s

00:10:23.030 --> 00:10:25.580
fridge, where we see it earlier on in the
film’s runtime.

00:10:25.580 --> 00:10:28.980
But during the photo album scene in the script,
the picture is described: “Annie’s mother

00:10:28.980 --> 00:10:31.270
guides a baby bottle into BABY CHARLIE’s
mouth.

00:10:31.270 --> 00:10:33.480
The bottle’s milk is polluted with black
herbs.”

00:10:33.480 --> 00:10:37.330
We would see these herbs and oils come up
several times more, like for example, on the

00:10:37.330 --> 00:10:39.070
doormats she created for her kids.

00:10:39.070 --> 00:10:42.630
As you would expect, Ellen treated Charlie
like a boy, so as not to upset Paimon.

00:10:42.630 --> 00:10:44.450
– [Charlie] She wanted me to be a boy.

00:10:44.450 --> 00:10:48.650
– I find it interesting that Ellen gives Charles’s
doormat to Annie’s family, despite it clearly

00:10:48.650 --> 00:10:50.810
saying Charles, not Charlie.

00:10:50.810 --> 00:10:54.525
Almost like she’s trying to make King Paimon
feel more at home despite being in the wrong body.

00:10:54.525 --> 00:10:57.890
She also makes a doormat for her friend Joan,
who is a part of the cult as well.

00:10:57.890 --> 00:10:59.640
Hers is decorated with hexagrams.

00:10:59.640 --> 00:11:03.630
The hexagram is also known as The Seal of
Solomon, as in Solomon the King, after whom

00:11:03.630 --> 00:11:05.820
the grimoire, The Lesser Key of Solomon is
named.

00:11:05.820 --> 00:11:09.670
Solomon is said to be the first man to ever
use demonic spells to his own advantage.

00:11:09.670 --> 00:11:13.030
Joan’s doormat also contains the black herb
imagery seen on the others.

00:11:13.030 --> 00:11:16.260
Another gift Ellen gave to her daughter was
this necklace of Paimon’s sigil.

00:11:16.260 --> 00:11:18.000
Ellen can be seen wearing the same necklace.

00:11:18.000 --> 00:11:21.060
It’s possible that this creates a spiritual
connection between the two, allowing Annie

00:11:21.060 --> 00:11:24.500
to be a victim of Paimon’s manipulation,
based on what happens next.

00:11:24.500 --> 00:11:25.810
– Annie is a sleepwalker.

00:11:25.810 --> 00:11:30.130
When the kids were young enough to share a
room, she covered them and herself in flammable

00:11:30.130 --> 00:11:34.910
paint thinner in their sleep and lit a match,
only waking up just in time to put it out

00:11:34.910 --> 00:11:36.570
before setting everyone ablaze.

00:11:36.570 --> 00:11:40.930
It seems that Annie is subconsciously at King
Paimon’s will, but her conscious mind is

00:11:40.930 --> 00:11:43.680
strong enough to resist his manipulation.

00:11:43.680 --> 00:11:47.430
Perhaps going through so much family trauma
as a kid and being married to a psychiatrist

00:11:47.430 --> 00:11:51.330
as an adult made her waking mind tough, and
harder for the demon to penetrate.

00:11:51.330 --> 00:11:56.080
This may explain why she is vulnerable only
in her dreams and prone to sleepwalking.

00:11:56.080 --> 00:12:00.340
This mental toughness seems to keep Paimon
out of her head for the most part.

00:12:00.340 --> 00:12:05.140
It’s implied that psychological turmoil
makes it easier for him to possess a victim.

00:12:05.140 --> 00:12:09.580
Remember, it is only after breaking Peter
down with tragedy after tragedy that he becomes

00:12:09.580 --> 00:12:11.130
available as a vessel.

00:12:11.130 --> 00:12:15.900
The cult’s plan, broken down into simplest
terms, seems to have three steps.

00:12:15.900 --> 00:12:19.020
Step 1: Break down the family’s psyche using
tragic events.

00:12:19.020 --> 00:12:24.200
Step 2: Convince them to open themselves up
to demonic possession by performing a seance,

00:12:24.200 --> 00:12:26.470
which is secretly an ancient ritual.

00:12:26.470 --> 00:12:30.550
Step 3: Possess Peter so he can take his place
in front of the congregation.

00:12:30.550 --> 00:12:34.500
The sleepwalking incident with the paint thinner
is part of Step 1.

00:12:34.500 --> 00:12:38.610
It planted a seed of distrust in Peter towards
his mother from a young age, and he would

00:12:38.610 --> 00:12:42.000
never be fully convinced that she really was
sleepwalking.

00:12:42.000 --> 00:12:44.840
This would come back as an advantage for Paimon
later on.

00:12:44.840 --> 00:12:48.112
– [Zac] As Ellen got older, she continued
to keep her life as a cult leader a secret

00:12:48.112 --> 00:12:49.112
from her family.

00:12:49.112 --> 00:12:53.120
Her photo album documents some of the strange
rituals she engaged in with Paimon’s cult,

00:12:53.120 --> 00:12:55.990
including one where she is showered in gold
coins while wearing what looks similar to

00:12:55.990 --> 00:12:56.990
a wedding dress.

00:12:56.990 --> 00:13:00.670
I would identify this as a result of the promise
of riches detailed in the spellbook that teaches

00:13:00.670 --> 00:13:02.090
the summoning of King Paimon.

00:13:02.090 --> 00:13:05.780
There are also many photos of Joan, who seems
to be her right hand woman, the next highest

00:13:05.780 --> 00:13:07.140
ranking person in the cult.

00:13:07.140 --> 00:13:10.910
Ellen’s continued dedication to King Paimon
and the cult caused others to take notice,

00:13:10.910 --> 00:13:13.520
and they perceived her strange behaviors as
mental illness.

00:13:13.520 --> 00:13:15.470
– [Annie] She didn’t have an easy life.

00:13:15.470 --> 00:13:19.010
She had DID, which became extreme at the end.

00:13:19.010 --> 00:13:20.010
And dementia.

00:13:20.010 --> 00:13:24.120
– Obviously, this was just the way Annie interpreted
her mother’s communications with the spirit world.

00:13:24.120 --> 00:13:27.950
Everyone in the family tree with a blood relation
to Ellen is diagnosed with some kind of mental

00:13:27.950 --> 00:13:29.680
illness at one point or another.

00:13:29.680 --> 00:13:33.140
From the outside, it would appear that it
runs in the family; that it’s hereditary.

00:13:33.140 --> 00:13:37.140
But it seems very likely that each case was
actually a reaction to demonic activity that

00:13:37.140 --> 00:13:39.260
was interpreted as mental illness.

00:13:39.260 --> 00:13:42.010
Because of the guilt she felt about their
relationship, Annie took her mother in to

00:13:42.010 --> 00:13:43.990
live at the house with them near the end of
her life.

00:13:43.990 --> 00:13:47.070
She stayed in an extra bedroom at the end
of the hall where she carved this triangle

00:13:47.070 --> 00:13:48.070
into the floor.

00:13:48.070 --> 00:13:52.180
It’s pointed diagonally, which made me wonder
if this was another sign to look to the Northwest.

00:13:52.180 --> 00:13:55.400
Looking for answers online brought me to the
movie’s script, which does indeed specify

00:13:55.400 --> 00:13:57.662
that the triangle is pointed Northwest.

00:13:57.662 --> 00:14:00.550
Triangles also seem to be an important part
of the spellbinding process.

00:14:00.550 --> 00:14:04.940
When we see the ritual in progress in Joan’s
apartment, a photo of Peter is placed inside

00:14:04.940 --> 00:14:07.290
a triangle that has been crudely carved into
the kitchen table.

00:14:07.290 --> 00:14:10.728
Long story short: Ellen had been performing
demonic rituals in her room while living at

00:14:10.728 --> 00:14:11.517
the house.

00:14:11.517 --> 00:14:15.601
Annie is a professional artist who makes miniatures
of many scenes from her and her family’s life.

00:14:15.601 --> 00:14:18.810
As far as we know, these are all real moments
that she’s recreating.

00:14:18.810 --> 00:14:22.600
One miniature we only see in passing is this
one, depicting Ellen standing in Steven and

00:14:22.600 --> 00:14:24.890
Annie’s doorway like a ghost in the middle
of the night.

00:14:24.890 --> 00:14:27.270
Does this mean Ellen was also a sleepwalker?

00:14:27.270 --> 00:14:29.790
Is this another trait that was passed down
to Annie?

00:14:29.790 --> 00:14:33.660
Or was Ellen attempting to do something to
them as they slept, perhaps something involving

00:14:33.660 --> 00:14:34.670
dark magic?

00:14:34.670 --> 00:14:37.020
If that’s the case, it would not be her
first time.

00:14:37.020 --> 00:14:40.770
Ellen’s photo album contains evidence that
she used a family photo of Steven, Annie,

00:14:40.770 --> 00:14:43.730
Peter and Charlie as part of some candlelight
ritual with the cult.

00:14:43.730 --> 00:14:47.180
This could explain the bizarre series of events
that seems to be aimed at the Graham family

00:14:47.180 --> 00:14:49.434
shortly after Ellen’s passing.

00:14:49.434 --> 00:14:52.954
(impact)

00:14:54.563 --> 00:14:58.326
(mysterious music)

00:14:58.326 --> 00:15:02.530
Before her mortal body fails her, Ellen writes
a note to her daughter which vaguely alludes

00:15:02.530 --> 00:15:06.410
to the benefits of resurrecting King Paimon;
though in order to make sure her plan goes

00:15:06.410 --> 00:15:10.450
off undisturbed, does not mention any of the
specifics, like her involvement in cult activity.

00:15:10.450 --> 00:15:14.630
The card reads: “My darling, dear, beautiful
Annie, Forgive me all the things I could not

00:15:14.630 --> 00:15:15.630
tell you.

00:15:15.630 --> 00:15:17.850
Please don’t hate me and try not to despair
your losses.

00:15:17.850 --> 00:15:19.580
You will see in the end that they were worth
it.

00:15:19.580 --> 00:15:21.720
Our sacrifice will pale next to the rewards.

00:15:21.720 --> 00:15:22.830
Love, Mommy.”

00:15:22.830 --> 00:15:26.680
As her health declined, she was moved to hospice
before her death on April 3rd, 2018.

00:15:26.680 --> 00:15:30.260
Her funeral was held at Spring Blossom Cemetery
on Saturday April 7th.

00:15:30.260 --> 00:15:32.680
That morning, Charlie sleeps outside in the
treehouse.

00:15:32.680 --> 00:15:36.420
Her father scolds her for this, saying she’ll
catch pneumonia, to which she responds…

00:15:36.420 --> 00:15:37.570
– That’s OK.

00:15:37.570 --> 00:15:41.150
– It seems Paimon could be aware that he’ll
soon be able to ditch this vessel.

00:15:41.150 --> 00:15:44.070
Later that morning, many of the cult members
showed up to mourn their Queen, unbeknownst

00:15:44.070 --> 00:15:46.500
to the family, who assumed they were Ellen’s
friends.

00:15:46.500 --> 00:15:50.370
During the viewing ceremony, one of the cult
members smears something on Ellen’s lips.

00:15:50.370 --> 00:15:53.400
In the movie it’s difficult to see what
exactly she’s smearing, but the script once

00:15:53.400 --> 00:15:54.810
again adds more clarification.

00:15:54.810 --> 00:15:57.320
“An older WOMAN arrives at the open casket.

00:15:57.320 --> 00:15:59.640
Her finger is dipped into a small bottle of
OIL.

00:15:59.640 --> 00:16:02.910
She quickly and covertly STREAKS the oil along
the corpse’s lips.”

00:16:02.910 --> 00:16:06.371
There are other instances in the script where
Annie discovers bottles of oils and herbs

00:16:06.371 --> 00:16:09.980
in the box of her mother’s old possessions,
so I think this oil serves a similar purpose

00:16:09.980 --> 00:16:13.490
as the herbs seen in Charlie’s botte, to
help make it easier to communicate with the

00:16:13.490 --> 00:16:14.490
spirits.

00:16:14.490 --> 00:16:18.070
– [Sarah] That night, while putting her
daughter to bed, Annie notices the word Satony

00:16:18.070 --> 00:16:19.370
written on Charlie’s wall.

00:16:19.370 --> 00:16:24.380
Satony is a word associated with invocation,
or the calling upon a demon or supernatural

00:16:24.380 --> 00:16:25.380
entity.

00:16:25.380 --> 00:16:28.569
Specifically, it seems to be used for necromancy
rituals.

00:16:28.569 --> 00:16:31.490
Necromancy is the act of communicating with
the dead.

00:16:31.490 --> 00:16:35.570
Shortly after Annie discovered the card left
by her mother, she turns the light off and

00:16:35.570 --> 00:16:37.690
sees her ghost standing in the dark.

00:16:37.690 --> 00:16:42.660
The inclusion of Satony on Charlie’s wall
may not just be for her to communicate with

00:16:42.660 --> 00:16:47.020
Ellen, but potentially all of the cult members
who are now staying close outside the house.

00:16:47.020 --> 00:16:51.234
At times you can hear what sounds like the
echoes of ritualistic chanting…

00:16:51.234 --> 00:16:57.769
(distant chanting)

00:16:58.410 --> 00:17:02.440
At night we see someone breathing outside
of Peter’s window and Charlie comes across

00:17:02.440 --> 00:17:06.140
a strange woman burning something in the field
outside their home.

00:17:06.140 --> 00:17:10.559
All of these forces are at play to ensure
that the entire ritual goes according to plan.

00:17:10.559 --> 00:17:14.409
– [Zac] The revival of Paimon at the expense
of the Graham family is analogous to the Heracles

00:17:14.409 --> 00:17:16.139
discussion in Peter’s English class.

00:17:16.139 --> 00:17:18.220
Heracles was a hero in Greek mythology.

00:17:18.220 --> 00:17:21.949
Peter’s classmate explains that Heracles’s
fatal flaw is arrogance.

00:17:21.949 --> 00:17:25.779
– Because he literally refuses to look at
all the signs that are literally being handed

00:17:25.779 --> 00:17:27.179
to him the entire play.

00:17:27.179 --> 00:17:31.059
– Throughout Hereditary, we see clues that the
family is being manipulated by this demonic

00:17:31.059 --> 00:17:34.870
cult, but most viewers won’t recognize them
on first watch, or before watching Things

00:17:34.870 --> 00:17:35.870
You Missed.

00:17:35.870 --> 00:17:39.620
However, the English teacher reminds the class
that the author, Sophocles, wrote the Oracle’s

00:17:39.620 --> 00:17:43.870
vision as absolute, meaning Heracles could
not have avoided his fate no matter what,

00:17:43.870 --> 00:17:47.490
so the discussion shifts to a debate about
if this is more or less tragic than a story

00:17:47.490 --> 00:17:48.830
where the characters have agency.

00:17:48.830 --> 00:17:52.220
– [Classmate] I think it’s more tragic because if
it’s all just inevitable then that means

00:17:52.220 --> 00:17:53.580
that the characters had no hope.

00:17:53.580 --> 00:17:57.529
They never had hope because they’re all
just like hopeless pawns in this horrible hopeless

00:17:57.529 --> 00:17:58.177
machine.

00:17:58.177 --> 00:18:01.570
– The Graham family was destined to go through
these tragedies, because their world is being

00:18:01.570 --> 00:18:02.970
manipulated by Paimon.

00:18:02.970 --> 00:18:06.289
The girl in Peter’s class calls The Oracle
characters “pawns”, and we could also

00:18:06.289 --> 00:18:10.830
apply the chess metaphor to Hereditary, where
characters are pawns to the desires of King

00:18:10.830 --> 00:18:12.340
Paimon and Queen Leigh.

00:18:12.340 --> 00:18:16.400
– [Sarah] That afternoon, Charlie collects
the bird that crashed into the window during

00:18:16.400 --> 00:18:19.750
her class, and cuts off the head for later
use in one of her crafts.

00:18:19.750 --> 00:18:24.070
This is the first example of decapitation,
which is the one aspect of King Paimon in

00:18:24.070 --> 00:18:28.379
the movie that doesn’t seem to be derived
from The Lesser Key of Solomon or any of the

00:18:28.379 --> 00:18:30.640
other grimoires or ancient texts that mention
him.

00:18:30.640 --> 00:18:34.879
It also foreshadows the ending, where Charlie’s
own head would be placed upon a mannequin

00:18:34.879 --> 00:18:36.540
to serve as a demonic idol.

00:18:36.540 --> 00:18:41.059
The Invocations book found in Ellen’s box
does contain a drawing of Paimon riding on

00:18:41.059 --> 00:18:43.370
the dromedary with three heads as cargo.

00:18:43.370 --> 00:18:47.950
This must be connected to the three generations
of women who are decapitated over the course

00:18:47.950 --> 00:18:48.950
of the story.

00:18:48.950 --> 00:18:53.530
Birds also seem to be a special symbol for
King Paimon, almost as if he associates himself

00:18:53.530 --> 00:18:54.530
with a great bird.

00:18:54.530 --> 00:18:58.250
Charlie draws a picture of a bird wearing
a king’s crown in her sketchbook, she has

00:18:58.250 --> 00:19:03.149
artwork of a bird beside her bed, her desk
is filled with sticks and nests, and the treehouse

00:19:03.149 --> 00:19:06.120
where she likes to spend most of her time
resembles a birdhouse.

00:19:06.120 --> 00:19:10.379
The cult moves swiftly after the burial to
recover Ellen’s body, because it would later

00:19:10.379 --> 00:19:12.850
play an important role in the evocation ceremony.

00:19:12.850 --> 00:19:15.909
For the time being, they stash it inside the
Grahams’ attic.

00:19:15.909 --> 00:19:18.990
– A week after her mother’s death,
Annie attends a support group.

00:19:18.990 --> 00:19:22.450
If this is exactly one week later, the date
is Tuesday April 10th, which means we are

00:19:22.450 --> 00:19:24.179
coming up on Friday the 13th.

00:19:24.179 --> 00:19:28.100
That seems fitting, considering that Friday
the 13th and occultism are both only observed

00:19:28.100 --> 00:19:29.339
by the superstitious.

00:19:29.339 --> 00:19:33.010
– Careful Zac you don’t want to
piss off the non-skeptics like last time.

00:19:33.010 --> 00:19:36.080
(angry chatter)

00:19:36.080 --> 00:19:39.340
– [Zac] When Charlie is working on her crafts,
she sees this light flare travel across the

00:19:39.340 --> 00:19:41.679
room and direct her attention to the window.

00:19:41.679 --> 00:19:44.000
Everyone is going to have their own interpretations
about what this is.

00:19:44.000 --> 00:19:47.649
Personally, I see it as the life energy of
an entity with no human vessel.

00:19:47.649 --> 00:19:50.410
And I believe we see multiple entities travel
in this form.

00:19:50.410 --> 00:19:53.430
In this case, it’s Ellen, who is trying
to point something out to King Paimon, who

00:19:53.430 --> 00:19:54.860
is still inside of Charlie.

00:19:54.860 --> 00:19:58.260
We see the light flare close in on the window,
and Charlie gets up to look out that window

00:19:58.260 --> 00:20:00.840
before going outside towards the treehouse.

00:20:00.840 --> 00:20:03.240
That night, Charlie goes with Peter to a school
party.

00:20:03.240 --> 00:20:06.730
On the way there, they drive past a telephone
pole with the Paimon insignia carved into

00:20:06.730 --> 00:20:10.434
it, suggesting it was always the cult’s
plan for Charlie to be killed at this spot.

00:20:10.434 --> 00:20:13.610
At the party, Peter goes into a private room
with friends, where two kids are watching

00:20:13.610 --> 00:20:15.749
a decapitation scene from an old movie.

00:20:15.749 --> 00:20:19.660
Like Heracles, Peter was being given many
signs about the impending tragedy, but was

00:20:19.660 --> 00:20:21.159
still powerless to prevent it.

00:20:21.159 --> 00:20:22.549
Charlie eats a cake with nuts…

00:20:22.549 --> 00:20:24.659
– …seemingly way too many nuts…

00:20:24.659 --> 00:20:27.759
– …I think any cake with nuts has
too many nuts, but in this case, the cake

00:20:27.759 --> 00:20:31.350
triggers her allergy, so Peter tries to rush
her to the hospital, but a deer in the road

00:20:31.350 --> 00:20:34.319
causes him to swerve out of the way while
she’s sticking her head out the window for air.

00:20:34.319 --> 00:20:37.881
The telephone pole cleanly knocks the head
off of her shoulders, and with that, the first

00:20:37.881 --> 00:20:40.100
part of the cult’s plan was all but complete.

00:20:40.100 --> 00:20:43.429
Paimon was now released from the confines
of Charlie’s female body, and this loss

00:20:43.429 --> 00:20:45.249
would send the family spiraling.

00:20:45.249 --> 00:20:49.019
To use Peter’s school lessons as an example
again, it was a “Great Crash” which led

00:20:49.019 --> 00:20:51.279
to a “Great Depression” in the family.

00:20:51.279 --> 00:20:53.990
Someone from the cult would go retrieve the
head at some point, for later use.

00:20:53.990 --> 00:20:58.179
The family’s reaction to Charlie’s death
is very different than the reaction to Ellen’s.

00:20:58.179 --> 00:21:01.890
Everyone in the family is completely destroyed,
which seems to also be part of the plan.

00:21:01.890 --> 00:21:05.440
As we mentioned before, it seems like you
have to be mentally deteriorated and broken

00:21:05.440 --> 00:21:07.120
before the demon can possess your soul.

00:21:07.120 --> 00:21:10.789
We’ve seen similar ideas expressed over
in the Conjuring franchise, which also deals

00:21:10.789 --> 00:21:12.390
with demons from The Lesser Key of Solomon.

00:21:12.390 --> 00:21:16.130
Usually, Ed and Lorraine Warren come to a
family to investigate the paranormal, but

00:21:16.130 --> 00:21:19.970
we also see them mend issues in the family’s
day to day life, boosting their morale and

00:21:19.970 --> 00:21:22.590
making them stronger in their fight against
the demonic entity.

00:21:22.590 --> 00:21:25.960
Hereditary lacks any psychic superheroes,
and there’s not really anyone to help the

00:21:25.960 --> 00:21:27.929
Grahams make it through their tragedies.

00:21:27.929 --> 00:21:31.639
After the funeral, Steven discovers the word
“zazas” written on the wall in their bedroom.

00:21:31.639 --> 00:21:33.710
This is another invocation term left by the
cult.

00:21:33.710 --> 00:21:38.460
Zazas is similar to Zaza or Zozo, which is
part of a supposed phenomenon among Ouija

00:21:38.460 --> 00:21:43.769
board users where, upon asking who they are
speaking to, the board would spell out Z-A-Z-A

00:21:43.769 --> 00:21:45.080
or Z-O-Z-O.

00:21:45.080 --> 00:21:47.990
This is essentially evidence that the cult
has been in the house to communicate with

00:21:47.990 --> 00:21:48.990
the other side.

00:21:48.990 --> 00:21:51.960
The family was right where the cult wanted
them, and their desperate hour would lead

00:21:51.960 --> 00:21:55.026
to the most disturbing set of circumstances
yet.

00:21:55.026 --> 00:21:58.346
(impact)

00:22:00.001 --> 00:22:03.258
(mysterious music)

00:22:03.258 --> 00:22:07.629
– [Sarah] Annie, desperate for some kind
of last connection to her late daughter, sleeps

00:22:07.629 --> 00:22:12.600
in the treehouse outside, and uses space heaters
to keep warm, which emit a red glow reminiscent

00:22:12.600 --> 00:22:13.870
of the fires of hell.

00:22:13.870 --> 00:22:18.080
Like everything we’ve seen so far, this
has a purpose, it foreshadows the use of the

00:22:18.080 --> 00:22:20.941
treehouse as a demonic chapel at the end of
the story.

00:22:20.941 --> 00:22:24.749
The next time Annie visits the support group,
Joan makes a move to get close to her and

00:22:24.749 --> 00:22:29.179
gain her trust, by introducing herself, and
making herself relatable by saying her son

00:22:29.179 --> 00:22:31.379
and grandson drowned a few months ago.

00:22:31.379 --> 00:22:35.440
Neither me or CZ are particularly convinced
that Joan ever even had a son and grandson,

00:22:35.440 --> 00:22:37.070
but we’ll get to that.

00:22:37.070 --> 00:22:41.289
Joan needs Annie to open her family up to
the occult by performing a ritual herself,

00:22:41.289 --> 00:22:45.039
so she positions herself as a friend in order
to eventually encourage her.

00:22:45.039 --> 00:22:49.750
A day later, one of the cult members slips
a flier about the open séance into the Grahams’

00:22:49.750 --> 00:22:55.034
mail slot, but it gets ignored, so Joan switches
to Plan B: continue to try to freak Annie out.

00:22:55.034 --> 00:22:59.129
As she’s working on her miniatures, some
supernatural force knocks over one of her

00:22:59.129 --> 00:23:00.129
paint bottles.

00:23:00.129 --> 00:23:03.019
– [Zac] I guess we could call this a tiny
little air yeet.

00:23:03.019 --> 00:23:04.019
(not so dramatic horn)

00:23:04.019 --> 00:23:07.559
– The spill directs her attention
to the slip of paper with Joan’s number,

00:23:07.559 --> 00:23:09.649
so Annie finally decides to visit her.

00:23:09.649 --> 00:23:13.900
Joan makes her tea, and when Annie drinks
it, a black herb gets stuck to her lip, the

00:23:13.900 --> 00:23:18.580
same herbs seen before in Charlie’s bottle
meant to make the subject more receptive to

00:23:18.580 --> 00:23:19.580
necromancy.

00:23:19.580 --> 00:23:23.870
Joan is essentially buttering her up to be
possessed by an evil spirit, look how her

00:23:23.870 --> 00:23:28.320
eyes dart to the teacup when Annie puts it
down, checking to make sure she consumed what

00:23:28.320 --> 00:23:29.440
she was supposed to.

00:23:29.440 --> 00:23:33.029
– [Zac] During their next encounter, Joan
tells Annie that a medium came over and conjured

00:23:33.029 --> 00:23:34.029
her grandson.

00:23:34.029 --> 00:23:37.120
She demonstrates the ritual, where Annie sees
a glass slide on it’s own, something blows

00:23:37.120 --> 00:23:41.210
on Annie’s hair and some supernatural entity
writes the words “I luv yu granma” on

00:23:41.210 --> 00:23:42.210
a chalkboard.

00:23:42.210 --> 00:23:45.250
She tries to make Annie believe her grandson
is doing all of this, but I personally think

00:23:45.250 --> 00:23:48.010
there is no grandson and Paimon’s spirit
is responsible.

00:23:48.010 --> 00:23:51.820
I say this because most seven year olds probably
wouldn’t be THIS bad at spelling, maybe

00:23:51.820 --> 00:23:55.179
I’m wrong, but Ari Aster has also stated:
“it’s a piece of misdirection.

00:23:55.179 --> 00:23:59.009
It plays as a séance scene but really it’s
a much darker conjuring, and they need Annie

00:23:59.009 --> 00:24:02.769
to take part in it in order to bring it in
the house and in order to further this ritual

00:24:02.769 --> 00:24:03.269
along.

00:24:03.269 --> 00:24:05.590
When she invites it in, she escalates things.”

00:24:05.590 --> 00:24:07.240
So that’s exactly what happens.

00:24:07.240 --> 00:24:09.929
Joan explains how Annie might be able to talk
to her own daughter.

00:24:09.929 --> 00:24:13.860
– First
light the candle, then choose an item that

00:24:13.860 --> 00:24:15.590
belonged to your daughter.

00:24:15.590 --> 00:24:16.940
That will be your link.

00:24:16.940 --> 00:24:18.301
Mine was the chalkboard.

00:24:18.301 --> 00:24:19.568
That’s my link…

00:24:19.568 --> 00:24:24.476
It's alright. It's alright. It's OK. There you go.

00:24:24.476 --> 00:24:28.690
Then when you’re ready, read this out loud.

00:24:28.690 --> 00:24:29.760
Every syllable.

00:24:29.760 --> 00:24:31.309
– The inscription is in a different language.

00:24:31.309 --> 00:24:34.790
Joan acts like she doesn’t know what it
is, but again, she’s probably lying, and

00:24:34.790 --> 00:24:37.970
she mentions that every member of the family
needs to be in the house, probably to ensure

00:24:37.970 --> 00:24:39.369
that she can curse all of them.

00:24:39.369 --> 00:24:43.279
While driving home, Annie hears the *click*
sound that Charlie used to make, telling us

00:24:43.279 --> 00:24:44.919
that Paimon’s spirit is with her.

00:24:44.919 --> 00:24:46.769
She wakes everyone up to perform the séance.

00:24:46.769 --> 00:24:50.919
They see “Charlie” move the glass on the
table, open the cabinet door, and toggle the

00:24:50.919 --> 00:24:52.149
flame on the candle.

00:24:52.149 --> 00:24:55.889
Of course, this is not really Charlie, this
is King Paimon responding to the dark ritual

00:24:55.889 --> 00:24:59.440
that Annie is performing, and as a result,
he possesses the body of Annie, causing her

00:24:59.440 --> 00:25:02.151
to emit this creepy demonic sounding noise.

00:25:02.151 --> 00:25:09.267
(demonic growl)

00:25:09.267 --> 00:25:12.720
…before taking over her body and seemingly
speaking as Charlie.

00:25:12.720 --> 00:25:13.720
– Hello?

00:25:13.720 --> 00:25:14.720
Mom?

00:25:14.720 --> 00:25:15.720
Mom!

00:25:15.720 --> 00:25:16.720
Mom?

00:25:16.720 --> 00:25:20.279
– I’m not sure if this is Paimon taking a
moment to adjust to being in a new body, or

00:25:20.279 --> 00:25:24.200
if Paimon is acting like Charlie to deliberately
freak out Peter, but it doesn't really matter,

00:25:24.200 --> 00:25:26.490
because Peter absolutely gets freaked out.

00:25:26.490 --> 00:25:30.350
This does raise the question: if Paimon wants
to inhibit a male body, why does he first

00:25:30.350 --> 00:25:31.919
go for Annie, not Peter?

00:25:31.919 --> 00:25:34.419
I think it’s because Peter essentially wasn’t
ready yet.

00:25:34.419 --> 00:25:36.760
Annie had been driven to madness by that month’s
events.

00:25:36.760 --> 00:25:40.840
Peter was psychologically damaged, but hadn’t
quite completely lost his mind yet.

00:25:40.840 --> 00:25:44.850
Annie was also made more vulnerable by drinking
the herb spiked tea from Joan and being the

00:25:44.850 --> 00:25:48.549
one to physically perform the ritual because
she believed she could talk to Charlie again.

00:25:48.549 --> 00:25:51.929
By possessing Annie’s body, it would be
a lot easier for Paimon to continue to freak

00:25:51.929 --> 00:25:54.719
out Peter and drive him to the point where
he can also be possessed.

00:25:54.719 --> 00:25:58.360
– [Sarah] You could argue that Peter was
also buttered up to be possessed using the

00:25:58.360 --> 00:26:02.549
black herbs, because he’s shown to have
a bag of marijuana that he smokes with friends.

00:26:02.549 --> 00:26:06.029
You could certainly make the case that the
cult slipped something in there, but then

00:26:06.029 --> 00:26:09.700
again, when Peter starts seeing the light
in class, we never see his friend react.

00:26:09.700 --> 00:26:12.980
– It also appears that Paimon doesn’t
permanently possess Annie.

00:26:12.980 --> 00:26:16.179
She seems to go back to normal after Steven
pours a glass of water in her face.

00:26:16.179 --> 00:26:19.019
It seems that Paimon doesn’t use her again
until later.

00:26:19.019 --> 00:26:22.389
My thought is that maybe he goes dormant inside
of her until the time is right.

00:26:22.389 --> 00:26:26.429
At this point, the words Liftoach and Pandemonium
appear on the wall in the hallway.

00:26:26.429 --> 00:26:30.460
Liftoach appears to be a rough English spelling
of a Hebrew word, לפתוח , which means

00:26:30.460 --> 00:26:34.509
open, and pandemonium you probably know, it
means chaos or mayhem.

00:26:34.509 --> 00:26:38.059
When we put these together, the phrase describes
how the family has now opened themselves up

00:26:38.059 --> 00:26:39.820
to the chaos and mayhem of hell.

00:26:39.820 --> 00:26:44.240
– This idea was confirmed when in
his Reddit Ask Me Anything, Ari Aster said

00:26:44.240 --> 00:26:47.360
that Liftoach Pandemonium translates as ‘open
up to chaos’

00:26:47.360 --> 00:26:51.500
– [Zac] I don’t know who runs the Hereditary
Subreddit, but huge missed opportunity not

00:26:51.500 --> 00:26:53.234
naming it He-Reddit-ary.

00:26:53.234 --> 00:26:54.970
– It’s Redditors, what do you
expect?!

00:26:54.970 --> 00:26:57.940
There also may be a dual meaning behind Pandemonium.

00:26:57.940 --> 00:27:04.234
The word was originally coined in 1667 by
English poet John Milton in his poem Paradise Lost.

00:27:04.234 --> 00:27:06.132
– [Milton] The Studio came to me with 'Stab'!

00:27:06.132 --> 00:27:08.320
– No, not that John Milton…

00:27:08.320 --> 00:27:12.940
The story references Lucifer’s rebellion
in heaven and subsequent banishing.

00:27:12.940 --> 00:27:17.910
At the suggestion of one of Lucifer’s followers,
the fallen angels built Pandemonium; a temple

00:27:17.910 --> 00:27:19.539
and the capital of hell.

00:27:19.539 --> 00:27:24.640
The word was crafted by joining pan, a Greek
word for ‘all’, and demonium, which is

00:27:24.640 --> 00:27:29.070
apparently Latin for ‘evil spirit’, creating
‘a place for all demons’.

00:27:29.070 --> 00:27:33.380
The word has evolved over the years with its
meaning ranging from ‘a place of disorder’

00:27:33.380 --> 00:27:34.700
to ‘lawless confusion’.

00:27:34.700 --> 00:27:36.330
(gunshots, sirens and laughter)

00:27:36.330 --> 00:27:37.490
– Much like Los Angeles.

00:27:37.490 --> 00:27:42.029
– It’s probably also around this
time when Joan sets up a ritual in her kitchen

00:27:42.029 --> 00:27:44.140
with the intention of targeting Peter.

00:27:44.140 --> 00:27:47.129
The room is covered in candles and draped
in white sheets.

00:27:47.129 --> 00:27:51.429
Peter’s photograph is taped to an idol in
front of some kind of dish, as well as in

00:27:51.429 --> 00:27:53.879
the center of this triangle, as previously
mentioned.

00:27:53.879 --> 00:27:58.809
We also see a crude miniature version of the
treehouse chapel scene, foreshadowing the

00:27:58.809 --> 00:28:00.440
“rebirth” at the end of the movie.

00:28:00.440 --> 00:28:05.190
The bird that Charlie decapitated at her school
is mounted to one of the toys she used to

00:28:05.190 --> 00:28:06.190
tinker with.

00:28:06.190 --> 00:28:09.020
This represents the idol affixed to her own
head.

00:28:09.020 --> 00:28:13.549
The animals surrounding it represent her worshippers
bowing down to her in the treehouse.

00:28:13.549 --> 00:28:17.520
– It seems that Annie is not the only
one interested in creating miniature dioramas.

00:28:17.520 --> 00:28:19.270
This creates an interesting parallel.

00:28:19.270 --> 00:28:22.710
Annie loves to create and manipulate these
miniature scenes of moments from her and her

00:28:22.710 --> 00:28:23.710
family’s life.

00:28:23.710 --> 00:28:27.330
She believes she has control over these scenes,
but in reality, she is the one being controlled

00:28:27.330 --> 00:28:29.299
and manipulated by Paimon and the cult.

00:28:29.299 --> 00:28:32.379
We see this in the way that the exterior shots
of the house are photographed.

00:28:32.379 --> 00:28:36.960
Cinematographer Pawel Pogorzelski uses a tilt-shift
lens for many of the establishing shots.

00:28:36.960 --> 00:28:39.749
This type of lens is known to make its subjects
look like miniatures.

00:28:39.749 --> 00:28:43.909
It’s a subtle suggestion that Annie and
her family are actually the ones being manipulated.

00:28:43.909 --> 00:28:47.369
The Lesser Key of Solomon mentions one of
the benefits of summoning Paimon is his knowledge

00:28:47.369 --> 00:28:48.369
in art.

00:28:48.369 --> 00:28:52.489
Just as Annie is an artist manipulating miniature
scenes, think of Ellen as an artist manipulating

00:28:52.489 --> 00:28:53.489
her family.

00:28:53.489 --> 00:28:57.210
The next day, Paimon would continue to torture
Peter in new inventive ways, one of which

00:28:57.210 --> 00:28:59.917
plays on another ancient superstition.

00:29:02.482 --> 00:29:05.453
(impact)

00:29:07.875 --> 00:29:11.665
(eerie music)

00:29:11.665 --> 00:29:14.809
– [Zac] During history class, Peter sees
the Paimon light flare, and it directs his

00:29:14.809 --> 00:29:18.360
attention to the cabinet next to him where
his own reflection stares back at him with

00:29:18.360 --> 00:29:19.409
an evil grin.

00:29:19.409 --> 00:29:23.039
– One interpretation of this is
that the grinning reflection that we see is

00:29:23.039 --> 00:29:24.259
in fact Paimon.

00:29:24.259 --> 00:29:29.150
For centuries mirrors and reflective surfaces
have been believed to be incredibly powerful

00:29:29.150 --> 00:29:30.249
objects.

00:29:30.249 --> 00:29:34.190
Because of their dual nature of being one
part in the real world and one part in the

00:29:34.190 --> 00:29:39.059
world of celestial reflections they are sometimes
considered to be a boundary between the material

00:29:39.059 --> 00:29:40.667
and supernatural world.

00:29:40.667 --> 00:29:45.360
Mirrors have been thought to harness a variety
of powers from being used as a tool to scry

00:29:45.360 --> 00:29:50.200
or see into the future, to trapping the soul
of the recently dead and being a portal, similar

00:29:50.200 --> 00:29:52.740
to those seen in Alice Through the Looking
Glass.

00:29:52.740 --> 00:29:56.840
There are plenty of examples of the power
of mirrors across films and literature; whether

00:29:56.840 --> 00:30:01.029
it’s vampires having no reflection or calling
on Candyman or Bloody Mary.

00:30:01.029 --> 00:30:05.480
Peter nearly has a heart attack after hearing
the Paimon clicking sound that he associates

00:30:05.480 --> 00:30:07.089
with his dead sister.

00:30:07.089 --> 00:30:08.453
(click)

00:30:08.453 --> 00:30:11.820
This weird experience gives him the idea that
he’s being haunted.

00:30:11.820 --> 00:30:16.309
– [Stephen on phone] Peter just called me, Annie, terrified,
crying in the halls, convinced he's being

00:30:16.309 --> 00:30:18.710
threatened by some vengeful spirit.

00:30:18.710 --> 00:30:22.139
– In the night, Annie finds Charlie’s
sketchbook drawing up pictures of Peter all

00:30:22.139 --> 00:30:23.139
on its own.

00:30:23.139 --> 00:30:26.770
Peter is awoken by the click sound and he
sees a horrifying vision of Charlie standing

00:30:26.770 --> 00:30:28.450
in his room and losing her head.

00:30:28.450 --> 00:30:32.279
The family dog seems to react to this, causing
him to growl and bark, an example of the trope

00:30:32.279 --> 00:30:36.320
of animals being able to see supernatural happenings
that humans cannot, which also came into play

00:30:36.320 --> 00:30:37.990
when I talked about The Conjuring.

00:30:37.990 --> 00:30:41.760
Just then, a phantom pair of hands grab Peter
by the head and try to yank it off.

00:30:41.760 --> 00:30:45.340
This was most likely just a tactic to scare
him and further turn him against his mother,

00:30:45.340 --> 00:30:47.450
who had rushed into the room because of the
commotion.

00:30:47.450 --> 00:30:51.190
In an attempt to put an end to all the paranormal
horrors, Annie throws Charlie’s sketchbook

00:30:51.190 --> 00:30:54.330
into the fire, because she believes it is
the item that connected her to the world of

00:30:54.330 --> 00:30:57.820
the dead, and opened the family up to communication
with some other spirit.

00:30:57.820 --> 00:31:01.840
However, her own sleeve simultaneously catches
fire, demonstrating that she is now linked

00:31:01.840 --> 00:31:03.330
to the evil in the house.

00:31:03.330 --> 00:31:06.779
Desperate for answers, she tries to visit
Joan the next day, but she isn’t there,

00:31:06.779 --> 00:31:09.950
probably because she’s at Peter’s school
trying to expel his own soul from his body

00:31:09.950 --> 00:31:11.543
to clear the way for King Paimon.

00:31:11.543 --> 00:31:13.908
– I expel you!

00:31:13.908 --> 00:31:15.481
Zantany!

00:31:15.481 --> 00:31:17.117
Dagdany!

00:31:17.117 --> 00:31:19.020
Aparagon!

00:31:19.020 --> 00:31:20.442
Peter!

00:31:20.442 --> 00:31:23.467
Get out!

00:31:23.467 --> 00:31:26.960
– Back in school, he continues to be distracted
by the wave of light, which must be Paimon

00:31:26.960 --> 00:31:30.330
pointing him in the direction of the classroom,
where he completely loses it.

00:31:30.330 --> 00:31:33.739
He hears Charlie’s clicking sound from all
directions before his body contorts and he

00:31:33.739 --> 00:31:36.960
involuntarily slams his face into the desk,
breaking his nose.

00:31:36.960 --> 00:31:40.690
– [Sarah] Meanwhile, Annie sorts through
her mother’s old possessions, leading her

00:31:40.690 --> 00:31:44.279
to discover Ellen’s involvement in the occult
and friendship with Joan.

00:31:44.279 --> 00:31:48.799
She also comes across her Mom’s body rotting
in the attic, decapitated and dressed in a

00:31:48.799 --> 00:31:52.870
gown with the Paimon sigil, very likely embroidered
by Ellen herself.

00:31:52.870 --> 00:31:57.440
The symbol is also painted on the roof of
the attic, and she finally makes the connection

00:31:57.440 --> 00:32:00.879
that this icon matches the necklace given
to her by her mother.

00:32:00.879 --> 00:32:05.309
She still believes that burning the sketchbook
is the key to stopping the demonic infestation,

00:32:05.309 --> 00:32:09.149
but when she tosses it in the fire, her husband
is the one to go up in flames.

00:32:09.149 --> 00:32:11.139
I see this as a statement from Paimon.

00:32:11.139 --> 00:32:15.119
He’s sending a message to the family that
they have no control over outcomes.

00:32:15.119 --> 00:32:18.784
They’re not going to win, so they may as
well give up and allow the possession to take

00:32:18.784 --> 00:32:19.401
place.

00:32:19.401 --> 00:32:23.450
And that’s exactly what happens, Paimon
travels to her in light flare form and we

00:32:23.450 --> 00:32:27.679
see her expression change from mortified to
blank, much like the blank expression that

00:32:27.679 --> 00:32:30.390
was always seen plastered on Charlie’s face.

00:32:30.390 --> 00:32:33.809
Using Annie, Paimon would pull out all the
stops to get to Peter.

00:32:33.809 --> 00:32:38.039
He awakens in the middle of the night to see
an orange glow coming from the treehouse.

00:32:38.039 --> 00:32:41.830
Perhaps orange is Paimon’s favorite color,
based on the fact that he always wore an orange

00:32:41.830 --> 00:32:43.620
sweater while possessing Charlie.

00:32:43.620 --> 00:32:47.880
His mother’s body swims through the air
in the background, defying gravity, an example

00:32:47.880 --> 00:32:52.080
of the hints from the Invocations book that
Paimon’s abilities include manipulation

00:32:52.080 --> 00:32:53.130
of physics.

00:32:53.130 --> 00:32:57.440
Peter comes down to find the house totally
disheveled and his dad burnt to a crisp in

00:32:57.440 --> 00:32:58.759
front of the fireplace.

00:32:58.759 --> 00:33:03.230
Meanwhile, his mom is lurking on the ceiling
behind him, and the creepy smiling man from

00:33:03.230 --> 00:33:07.549
the funeral is naked in the closet doorway
with the sinister grin still not erased from

00:33:07.549 --> 00:33:08.549
his face.

00:33:08.549 --> 00:33:12.659
He turns back at a noise and his mom is gone,
having climbed over to the other corner.

00:33:12.659 --> 00:33:17.559
She roars and runs toward him, causing him
to run away into the open attic and lock himself

00:33:17.559 --> 00:33:18.059
in.

00:33:18.059 --> 00:33:21.889
Annie climbs onto the ceiling and repeatedly
bashes her head into the door.

00:33:21.889 --> 00:33:25.879
The whole attic is illuminated in candles
and the spot where Joan’s body had been

00:33:25.879 --> 00:33:30.919
kept now contains the photo of Peter, this
time with his eyes burned out, just like the

00:33:30.919 --> 00:33:33.200
photos that appeared in Charlie’s sketchbook.

00:33:33.200 --> 00:33:36.950
– Rumor has it that the original ending
involved Peter losing his eyes, which probably

00:33:36.950 --> 00:33:39.899
ties into the old saying, “eyes are the
windows to the soul”.

00:33:39.899 --> 00:33:42.480
Even though Peter doesn’t end up losing
them in the movie, I think this imagery still

00:33:42.480 --> 00:33:43.909
works on a symbolic level.

00:33:43.909 --> 00:33:47.669
After hearing a fleshy noise, Peter looks
up to find his mother floating above him,

00:33:47.669 --> 00:33:49.399
sawing her own head off with a thread.

00:33:49.399 --> 00:33:50.999
She stares intently at him.

00:33:50.999 --> 00:33:54.509
More unclothed cult members suddenly populate
the attic, and this seems to be the exact

00:33:54.509 --> 00:33:57.419
point where Peter loses it and he jumps out
the window.

00:33:57.419 --> 00:34:00.559
As he’s lying there, the beam of light floats
over and lands on him.

00:34:00.559 --> 00:34:03.690
It seems to be absorbed into him, which I
think is the most convincing evidence that

00:34:03.690 --> 00:34:07.519
the light flares we’ve been seeing are spirits
without a body to reside in; in this case,

00:34:07.519 --> 00:34:08.519
King Paimon.

00:34:08.519 --> 00:34:11.490
Annie floats into the treehouse and Peter
makes the clicking noise, confirming that

00:34:11.490 --> 00:34:15.120
at long last, the King has finally managed
to possess his male host.

00:34:15.120 --> 00:34:18.020
He climbs into the treehouse where there is
a ritual in progress.

00:34:18.020 --> 00:34:19.330
Rows of people are bowing down.

00:34:19.330 --> 00:34:21.100
He sees the mannequin at the altar.

00:34:21.100 --> 00:34:24.630
Charlie’s head wears a strange crown and
behind that, is a sunburst pattern, the same

00:34:24.630 --> 00:34:27.070
one seen on the cover of the Invocations book.

00:34:27.070 --> 00:34:31.040
Seeing this now brings to mind the Sun Gate
from Ari Aster’s second film, Midsommar.

00:34:31.040 --> 00:34:34.400
Which also had a triangle shaped temple, not
unlike the triangle we saw in Ellen’s room

00:34:34.400 --> 00:34:35.620
and throughout the movie.

00:34:35.620 --> 00:34:39.080
The mannequin is embossed with the Paimon
sigil and stands beside a birdcage containing

00:34:39.080 --> 00:34:40.080
a live bird.

00:34:40.080 --> 00:34:42.740
We already discussed the significance of birds
for King Paimon.

00:34:42.740 --> 00:34:46.320
Joan places the crown on Peter’s head and
assures him that everything is alright, now

00:34:46.320 --> 00:34:48.680
that he’s taken on his proper male form.

00:34:48.680 --> 00:34:53.669
– [Joan] You are Paimon, one of the eight kings
of Hell.

00:34:53.669 --> 00:34:57.160
In the Lesser Key of Solomon, Paimon is described
as one of the nine kings of hell.

00:34:57.160 --> 00:35:00.650
I wonder if this change was made to give more
meaning to the requirement to face the Northwest

00:35:00.650 --> 00:35:02.080
when calling upon King Paimon.

00:35:02.080 --> 00:35:05.040
That way each King is in charge of one cardinal
direction.

00:35:05.040 --> 00:35:10.359
– [Joan] We reject the Trinity and pray devoutly
to you, great Paimon.

00:35:10.359 --> 00:35:14.240
Give us your knowledge of all secret things.

00:35:14.240 --> 00:35:18.372
Bring us honor, wealth, and good familiars.

00:35:18.372 --> 00:35:27.240
Bind all men to our will, as we have bound
ourselves for now and ever to yours.

00:35:27.240 --> 00:35:30.990
With all three steps complete, the cult has
completed the transfer of vessels, and Paimon

00:35:30.990 --> 00:35:33.050
can lead from his desired male body.

00:35:33.050 --> 00:35:37.270
As for the Graham family, they really were
just pawns in a horrible hopeless machine.

00:35:37.270 --> 00:35:40.870
Which brings me to the same question posed
by Peter’s English teacher.

00:35:40.870 --> 00:35:45.340
Does the locked fate of the family, and inevitable
triumph of King Paimon make this story more

00:35:45.340 --> 00:35:47.317
tragic or less tragic?

00:35:47.317 --> 00:35:50.260
I want to give a huge shoutout to Sarah from
What The Horror!

00:35:50.260 --> 00:35:53.690
Without her research and analysis, this video
would not have been possible at all.

00:35:53.690 --> 00:35:56.410
What The Horror is one of the best up and
coming horror movie channels.

00:35:56.410 --> 00:36:01.300
She does reviews, rankings, and my personal
favorite: Truly Horror Chewsdays, where she

00:36:01.300 --> 00:36:04.470
goes over the behind-the-scenes stuff that
is sometimes stranger and scarier than the

00:36:04.470 --> 00:36:05.590
movies themselves.

00:36:05.590 --> 00:36:09.930
She just released her own video on Hereditary
vs Midsommar, a comparison of Ari Aster’s

00:36:09.930 --> 00:36:13.340
first two films, which you can check out by
clicking that video on the left.

00:36:13.340 --> 00:36:17.250
Be sure to drop her a sub, ring the deathbell
and select all notifications and we will see

00:36:17.250 --> 00:36:18.910
you in the next video.

00:36:18.910 --> 00:36:20.677
Assuming we both survive.

00:36:20.677 --> 00:36:31.491
(Jazz music with creepy undertones)

